{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79584,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bce16c1f18dcf0d4c37a6ef9f9ec8a6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hey! I am also a Karisma bride... getting married at El Dorado Royale in August of 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I considered the Azul properties (and loved them) but they decided to cut the kids off the list (there would have been 26 kids!!). I&#039;ve had such a great experience thus far working with the hotel. One thing I&#039;ve come to realize, is that it does take a few days for a response from the WC. But being this far out, it is understandable, and they have many weddings well before mine. maybe I&#039;m just very laid back.. But so far, no issues for me! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907343,"PostDate":1447173515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hey! I am also a Karisma bride... getting married at El Dorado Royale in August of 2016.<\/p>\n<p>I considered the Azul properties (and loved them) but they decided to cut the kids off the list (there would have been 26 kids!!). I've had such a great experience thus far working with the hotel. One thing I've come to realize, is that it does take a few days for a response from the WC. But being this far out, it is understandable, and they have many weddings well before mine. maybe I'm just very laid back.. But so far, no issues for me! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"embow345@aol.com","IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447171987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ekf6189","Id":285293,"Name":"ekf6189","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":19,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
