{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.99.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef6313721b5897cc9cfc61c6fb9a1749","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1889288\" timestamp=\"1426402152\"]\nI always say you need to pick something you&#039;ll stick to forever. That&#039;s what I try to do -- I&#039;m not going to deny things I love I&#039;m just going to limit them!!! And 19 is not unattainable, heck if I can lose what I did we both can lose 20 lbs!!! It&#039;s all a mind set.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nKim you&#039;re so good for my ego!! lol Seriously, I think some of it is age as well. Sometimes it feels like I look at food and gain weight!\n[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1889297\" timestamp=\"1426436193\"]\nYou are one amazing woman!! xx\n\nI can&#039;t believe how fast this wedding coming around! I will be ordering my dress at the end of April as I still have a little weight to lose!! I can then get it altered if I need to xx\n\nExciting \n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico[\/quote]\nHave you checked on the ordering? The end of April sounds awfully close for timing. I just did my dress on Friday and the salon really pressured me to get it done because of how close the timing is. I was stunned. She said it might come in earlier than they expect but she said six months, which gives me end of August then I have to schedule the alterations. We fly on October 17th so I definitely want to make sure it&#039;s all done before we go.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889326,"PostDate":1426439412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 15 March 2015 - 01:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I always say you need to pick something you'll stick to forever. That's what I try to do -- I'm not going to deny things I love I'm just going to limit them!!! And 19 is not unattainable, heck if I can lose what I did we both can lose 20 lbs!!! It's all a mind set.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kim you're so good for my ego!! lol Seriously, I think some of it is age as well. Sometimes it feels like I look at food and gain weight!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maybeoneday, on 15 March 2015 - 11:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You are one amazing woman!! xx<br><br>\nI can't believe how fast this wedding coming around! I will be ordering my dress at the end of April as I still have a little weight to lose!! I can then get it altered if I need to xx<br><br>\nExciting <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you checked on the ordering? The end of April sounds awfully close for timing. I just did my dress on Friday and the salon really pressured me to get it done because of how close the timing is. I was stunned. She said it might come in earlier than they expect but she said six months, which gives me end of August then I have to schedule the alterations. We fly on October 17th so I definitely want to make sure it's all done before we go.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf28db32aafa22e436af6b0f8acb58d0","RawContent":"I&#039;m sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn&#039;t happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889327,"PostDate":1426439743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn't happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406718672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bd8140f057f582c3ada5732333a7f89","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1889327\" timestamp=\"1426457743\"]\nI&#039;m sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn&#039;t happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well![\/quote]Don&#039;t feel bad. Me either. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889333,"PostDate":1426442808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 15 March 2015 - 05:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn't happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDon't feel bad. Me either. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.99.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fa819f4dfc01ed8ca8773e0bf1284b5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1889297\" timestamp=\"1426436193\"]\nYou are one amazing woman!! xx\n\nI can&#039;t believe how fast this wedding coming around! I will be ordering my dress at the end of April as I still have a little weight to lose!! I can then get it altered if I need to xx\n\nExciting \n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico[\/quote]\nAww thanks. I&#039;m really not but I appreciate the compliment.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889379,"PostDate":1426462432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maybeoneday, on 15 March 2015 - 11:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You are one amazing woman!! xx<br><br>\nI can't believe how fast this wedding coming around! I will be ordering my dress at the end of April as I still have a little weight to lose!! I can then get it altered if I need to xx<br><br>\nExciting <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Aww thanks. I'm really not but I appreciate the compliment.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426497800,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"0e1c431be3ad613b4dc1e26ac742ab3e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m going to try to lose weight..... I use Myfitnesspal and I find it really works when I&#039;m using it&amp;nbsp;faithfully...but it is a lot of work tracking everything! The key I think is to keep moving...I have a desk job, and very Low (like NONE) Iron so I am super tried and dizzy all the time! I started an Iron supplement&amp;nbsp;and now its warming up outside so I&#039;m going to try walking to work.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is all about the mind set like @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] said! Realistic goals...I know I&#039;m not going to lose 20lbs if I set my only goal that high.... so I&#039;m setting it for 5lbs at a time...eventually I get to the big 2-0! lol might take forever! haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nadiakat17\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve already resigned myself not to be&amp;nbsp;disappointed&amp;nbsp;if it doesn&#039;t happen....besides I&#039;m going on this trip with my&amp;nbsp;closest family and friends&amp;nbsp;and I&#039;m sure they don&#039;t care if I have a little jiggle around my middle as we drink and dance by the pool!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889401,"PostDate":1426497450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm going to try to lose weight..... I use Myfitnesspal and I find it really works when I'm using it\u00a0faithfully...but it is a lot of work tracking everything! The key I think is to keep moving...I have a desk job, and very Low (like NONE) Iron so I am super tried and dizzy all the time! I started an Iron supplement\u00a0and now its warming up outside so I'm going to try walking to work.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is all about the mind set like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> said! Realistic goals...I know I'm not going to lose 20lbs if I set my only goal that high.... so I'm setting it for 5lbs at a time...eventually I get to the big 2-0! lol might take forever! haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279229\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279229-nadiakat17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nadiakat17<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I've already resigned myself not to be\u00a0disappointed\u00a0if it doesn't happen....besides I'm going on this trip with my\u00a0closest family and friends\u00a0and I'm sure they don't care if I have a little jiggle around my middle as we drink and dance by the pool!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365774059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.181.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb90a0df86a058ebe35b80a4cbd0aefe","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1889327\" timestamp=\"1426457743\"]\nI&#039;m sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn&#039;t happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well![\/quote]I know I am struggling!! haha xx\n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1890094,"PostDate":1426779282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 15 March 2015 - 05:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm sad bc I tried to loose weight before the wedding and it didn't happen... I just love food too much I guess . Oh well!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI know I am struggling!! haha xx<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421803539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7146369cbf6b237388f31311f1b2664a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well some things are finally coming together. Azul Fives is out. We&#039;re back at Grand Coral Beach Club, booked and confirmed. Yay!! We&#039;re going to be up on the rooftop terrace overlooking the water. I&#039;m in the process now of deciding on a gazebo to set up, and figuring out flowers.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is what I&#039;ve found that I think I&#039;m going with, except I&#039;m going to add fuschia pink flowers to it half way up each side:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Doug is going to be wearing a turquoise&amp;nbsp; vest and tie, and my flowers are going to be fuschia so I want to keep the colour theme. I&#039;m thinking turquoise sashes - a couple for Grand Coral then a couple for the restaurant. Then I&#039;m thinking pink in a table centerpiece.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve picked out bags, but again I only need a couple and I know what&#039;s going in them but I&#039;m not going to worry about all that stuff for a while yet until we know absolutely who is going with us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I think I&#039;m done! lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890126,"PostDate":1426795839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well some things are finally coming together. Azul Fives is out. We're back at Grand Coral Beach Club, booked and confirmed. Yay!! We're going to be up on the rooftop terrace overlooking the water. I'm in the process now of deciding on a gazebo to set up, and figuring out flowers.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is what I've found that I think I'm going with, except I'm going to add fuschia pink flowers to it half way up each side:<\/p>\n<p>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1890126]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-232000-0-45650800-1426813439.jpg\" title=\"fja025.JPG -  135.64KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-232000-0-45650800-1426813439.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"fja025.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Doug is going to be wearing a turquoise\u00a0 vest and tie, and my flowers are going to be fuschia so I want to keep the colour theme. I'm thinking turquoise sashes - a couple for Grand Coral then a couple for the restaurant. Then I'm thinking pink in a table centerpiece.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've picked out bags, but again I only need a couple and I know what's going in them but I'm not going to worry about all that stuff for a while yet until we know absolutely who is going with us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I think I'm done! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbfd727061628a3f63d56e8ef46ab050","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ladies - I need some advice please. So I ordered the key card holders and I would swear I asked about a clear pouch but....... somewhere along the way it ended up being blue.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Well I picked them up from my son over the weekend and I really don&#039;t know what to do. I had my little key cards made:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But the blue of the pouch is so dark that when I put the card inside, it disappears. You can&#039;t read it. You can barely even see it!! Just NOT what I wanted at all. I know I can&#039;t send them back but I really don&#039;t know if I want to even use them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So - put up and shut up? Or find something else so that I can use my nifty little cards that I worked so hard at making????&amp;nbsp; Help!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892085,"PostDate":1428353164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ladies - I need some advice please. So I ordered the key card holders and I would swear I asked about a clear pouch but....... somewhere along the way it ended up being blue.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1892085]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-232000-0-06826400-1428370834.jpg\" title=\"zipper pouch.jpg -  101.51KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-232000-0-06826400-1428370834.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"zipper pouch.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well I picked them up from my son over the weekend and I really don't know what to do. I had my little key cards made:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=31464\" title=\"\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/ppt.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=31464\" title=\"\"><strong>keycard insert for zipper pouch.ppt<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>186KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">10 <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But the blue of the pouch is so dark that when I put the card inside, it disappears. You can't read it. You can barely even see it!! Just NOT what I wanted at all. I know I can't send them back but I really don't know if I want to even use them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So - put up and shut up? Or find something else so that I can use my nifty little cards that I worked so hard at making????\u00a0 Help!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac2bd7004f75c17b8035777e8ce3ab55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;how about playing around with the colors a bit? I know it&#039;s not ideal but it will be easier than ordering something new and all these pouches going to waste. The pink on the card seems to have quite a bit of blue in it so maybe that&#039;s why it&#039;s not showing up properly through the blue plastic. Maybe try with colors on the opposite side of the spectrum from blue and see what happens. Maybe it works?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If those colors are still not doing it for you, you could always try and sell the pouches on here, I&#039;m sure there&#039;s plenty of brides who would take them off your hands and then you&#039;re not at a total loss. That&#039;s too bad, they&#039;re really cute pouches though!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892117,"PostDate":1428365184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>how about playing around with the colors a bit? I know it's not ideal but it will be easier than ordering something new and all these pouches going to waste. The pink on the card seems to have quite a bit of blue in it so maybe that's why it's not showing up properly through the blue plastic. Maybe try with colors on the opposite side of the spectrum from blue and see what happens. Maybe it works?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If those colors are still not doing it for you, you could always try and sell the pouches on here, I'm sure there's plenty of brides who would take them off your hands and then you're not at a total loss. That's too bad, they're really cute pouches though!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fd39b63094979baeeb69b7aa041655d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh no!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do you have record of your color of choice being clear? &amp;nbsp;If they messed up, I think they should either exchange for the right color or atleast refund your money! &amp;nbsp;I realized you had them shipped to the states but you do still have some time for this to be made right.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I second what @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] said about the colors, although those are your wedding colors. &amp;nbsp;Maybe play around some and see if you can find a compromise that will show thru the darker blue.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Worst case you could try to sell them, but I think I would start with #1 and see what the company would do for me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892129,"PostDate":1428395366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh no!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do you have record of your color of choice being clear? \u00a0If they messed up, I think they should either exchange for the right color or atleast refund your money! \u00a0I realized you had them shipped to the states but you do still have some time for this to be made right.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I second what @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> said about the colors, although those are your wedding colors. \u00a0Maybe play around some and see if you can find a compromise that will show thru the darker blue.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Worst case you could try to sell them, but I think I would start with #1 and see what the company would do for me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":469,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":19,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
